---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout metadata={{ title: "Watchers in the Dark | Patrick O’Dell">
  <section class="book-hero">
    <div class="container">

      <img class="cover" src="/watchers-in-the-dark-cover.jpg" alt="Watchers in the Dark cover" />

      <div class="info">
        <h1>Watchers in the Dark</h1>

        <p class="series">The Godfire Series</p>

        <p class="blurb">
          Elias Fetch makes a living cleaning up supernatural messes, but even he has limits. When a soft-spoken stranger named Louis arrives in New Orleans with a disturbing problem, Elias is drawn into a case that feels wrong from the start.
        </p>

        <p class="blurb">
          What begins as a routine job unravels into something far older and more dangerous than the city itself, where drained bodies, fractured identities, and unseen forces begin to surface in the dark.
        </p>

        <p class="blurb">
          As Elias and the others are pulled deeper into a conflict involving fallen angels and buried histories, he discovers the truth may be more terrifying than what he knows.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn secondary" href="/books/watchers-in-the-dark/preview">Preview</a>
          <a class="btn primary" href="PASTE-PURCHASE-LINK">Pre-order</a>
        </div>

        <p class="meta">Coming 2027</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
